data: {"id": "524761fcfef64030-thinking-parallel_evidence-976", "run_id": "524761fcfef64030", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据汇总与分析\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes Pod 描述（kubectl_describe）\n- **Pod 状态**：`Pending`（对应 describe 输出中的 `status: Pending`），容器状态 `Waiting / Reason: ContainerCreating`\n- **调度节点**：`node2/10.2.0.50`\n- **控制器链**：`ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c` → `Deployment/workload`\n- **关键事件**（核心证据）：\n  - **`Warning FailedMount 27s (x35 over 55m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`**\n  - `Warning FailedMount 10m (x20 over 53m) kubelet Unable to attach or mou", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789048339004, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

